  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_01_old_00",
      "hash64": "75A030D90C5F91DC",
      "text": "Hello, hello. I hope everyone’s ready to learn\\nsome new things today![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_02_old_00",
      "hash64": "48291636FE03F357",
      "text": "Did you all try using the ZR Button to let your\\nPokémon out as I taught you in our last class?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "056101908DD0AEFF",
      "text": "Walking along with your Pokémon lets you see\\nhow unique and cute they all are.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "0560FE908DD0A9E6",
      "text": "I’d also highly recommend picnics for when you\\nwant to spend some quality time together with\\r\\nthe Pokémon in your party.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "0560FF908DD0AB99",
      "text": "You can get them all around the table to make\\nsandwiches and play—it’s really a lot of fun![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "0560FC908DD0A680",
      "text": "If you want to learn more about making food,\\nMr. Saguaro’s class is the best place to go![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "0560FD908DD0A833",
      "text": "Now, sometimes, while you’re enjoying a picnic\\nwith your Pokémon...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "05610A908DD0BE4A",
      "text": "you may find something very, VERY important in\\nthe basket next to your table![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "05610B908DD0BFFD",
      "text": "This very important something is what Pokémon\\nare born from. Let’s all say it together![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "3A32B96E379E9D53",
      "text": "Boxes!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "3A32BA6E379E9F06",
      "text": "Poké Balls!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "3A32BB6E379EA0B9",
      "text": "Eggs!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "3571AB7985C94A06",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Huh? Um...[VAR 0x0100(0000)], it looks\\nlike\\r\\nyou’re\\r\\nthe\\r\\nonly\\r\\none\\r\\nwho\\r\\nsaid Boxes.\\c\\nWe sometimes send Pokémon to Boxes for\\nsafekeeping, but they’re not born from them![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
