      "label": "class_a_02_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "3571AA7985C94853",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Huh? Um...[VAR 0x0100(0000)], it looks\\nlike\\r\\nyou’re\\r\\nthe\\r\\nonly\\r\\none\\r\\nwho\\r\\nsaid\\r\\nPoké Balls!\\c\\nI don’t believe there have been any Pokémon\\ndiscovered yet that are born from Poké Balls![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
